<title>UK: Rank says Q1 progress &quot;generally good&quot;.</title>
<headline>Rank says Q1 progress &quot;generally good&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure company The Rank Group Plc said on Thursday its businesses had made what it called generally good progress in the first quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;However, it has been a quiet period for video releases and lower operating profit in video duplication has broadly offset increases elsewhere...the outlook for the company is promising,&quot; Rank said in a statement for its annual general meeting.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
